\r\n      \"note\": \"Starting fix for ledger immutability triggers.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"status\": \"FIXED-UNVERIFIED\",\r\n      \"date\": \"2026-11-20\",\r\n      \"commit\": \"af12729225d5acc2312118d99080a1c8a72f557f\",\r\n      \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/evidence/after-F-009.txt\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Added PostgreSQL immutability triggers for stock_movement, sales_invoice, and sales_invoice_line with bypass setting for test resets.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"status\": \"REJECTED\",\r\n      \"date\": \"2026-11-20\",\r\n      \"commit\": \"af12729225d5acc2312118d99080a1c8a72f557f\",\r\n      \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/10-expected-vs-actual.txt\",\r\n      \"note\": \"REJECTED at Step 2, Step 4, and Step 5: (1) Broken column reference in migration.sql line 81: sales_invoice_line uses \\\"invoiceId\\\" not \\\"salesInvoiceId\\\", causing PL/pgSQL runtime crash on all line UPDATE/DELETE; (2) Status downgrade bypass: enforce_sales_invoice_immutability() allows updating status from POSTED to DRAFT, enabling subsequent unconditional DELETE of posted invoices; (3) Snapshot fields (customerNameSnapshot, companyGstinSnapshot) are unconstrained on POSTED invoices; (4) Mutant 3 survived because server/src/db-immutability.test.ts contains 0 tests for sales_invoice_line.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"status\": \"IN-PROGRESS\",\r\n      \"date\": \"2026-11-22\",\r\n      \"commit\": null,\r\n      \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/evidence/before-F-009-refix.txt\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Re-fixing F-009 to address 4 verifier rejection points.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"status\": \"FIXED-UNVERIFIED\",\r\n      \"date\": \"2026-11-22\",\r\n      \"commit\": \"ba71207ae75581b11bd721c95c3a00cfa8730500\",\r\n      \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/evidence/after-F-009-refix.txt\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Fixed sales_invoice_line column name, blocked status downgrade from POSTED to DRAFT, locked snapshot fields, and expanded tests in server/src/db-immutability.test.ts.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"status\": \"VERIFIED\",\r\n      \"date\": \"2026-11-22\",\r\n      \"commit\": \"ba71207ae75581b11bd721c95c3a00cfa8730500\",\r\n      \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/10-expected-vs-actual.txt\",\r\n      \"note\": \"VERIFIED in run 010: Independently verified across all 10 protocol checks. Fresh environment migrations pass from zero; original repro blocked; revert check proves regression test sensitivity (fails without fix, passes with fix); 5/5 mutants killed (0 survived); adversarial probes pass (status downgrade to DRAFT blocked, snapshot tampering blocked, 50 concurrent SQL UPDATEs blocked, valid payment transitions allowed, lines immutable on POSTED invoices); sibling sweep verified; 18/18 benchmark assertions and 10/10 SQL database invariants pass; full test suite passes; diff clean; OWASP ASVS 8.3.1, REQ-009, REQ-036, and CGST Section 130 satisfied.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"reproCommand\": \"npx vitest run --exclude '**/audit/**'\",\r\n  \"regressionTest\": \"server/src/db-immutability.test.ts\",\r\n  \"fixCommit\": \"ba71207ae75581b11bd721c95c3a00cfa8730500\",\r\n  \"verifyEvidence\": [\r\n    \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/01-fresh-environment.txt\",\r\n    \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/02-original-repro.txt\",\r\n    \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/03-test-validity.txt\",\r\n    \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/04-mutation-check.txt\",\r\n    \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/05-adversarial-probes.txt\",\r\n    \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/06-sibling-sweep.txt\",\r\n    \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/07-regression-radius.txt\",\r\n    \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/08-diff-review.txt\",\r\n    \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/09-standards-check.txt\",\r\n    \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/10-expected-vs-actual.txt\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"siblingSweep\": {\r\n    \"done\": true,\r\n    \"queryUsed\": \"git grep -n -E \\\"\\\\.(delete|deleteMany)\\\\(\\\" server/src/modules/ ; psql -c \\\"SELECT tgname, relname FROM pg